    "body": "I refactored this PR:\r\n- Factored out `match integrity metadata` helper to https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/13256\r\n- Introduce `module map entry` in https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/13257 -- taking the latter approach in https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/12922#discussion_r4562561755, removing in-flight record and aligning with `preload entry`.\r\n- The remaining diffs for this PR (after rebasing onto the two PRs above) are Commit https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/12922/changes/518a3a39f05f98452ea5ab7e906f89b7c1a2475b",
